    dissolution: unbound_dissolution(description: "a host-convergence step executes gunbc.serving.serving_provision_derivation serving_provision_derive's vllm arm on srv1 and reads the running container's inspect and engine banner back against it (its serving_provision_derivation frontier row carries the same trigger); the window procedure itself lands as a fleet procedure. SUFFICIENT for deleting this row, at which point the wrapper dissolves per its dissolves_to."),
  ),
  // One trigger row PER RETAINED EFFECT (review 86720, DESIGN 4b meta-obligation 3: a plural loss
