    dissolution: unbound_dissolution(description: "an exec/openssl effect row (gunbc.host host_effect_realize vocabulary or extdeps.openssl) models generating and idempotently reusing a self-signed cert at a path, after which the wrapper's [ -s tls.key ] || openssl block is a realization of that row. SUFFICIENT for retiring this trigger row."),
